<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 40,800 MT were off two-thirds from the previous week and the 4-week average.  Major increases for Malaysia (13,800 MT), the Netherlands (11,100 MT), Spain (10,700 MT), and Canada (9,500 MT) were partially offset by reductions for unknown destinations (19,800 MT) and Italy (10,700 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 83,100 MT were down slightly from the week earlier and one-third below the 4-week average.  Turkey (16,900 MT), Canada (16,500 MT), Australia (15,100 MT), and Malaysia (13,800 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
